  "kind": "layout",
  "id": "ja/gojuon",
  "name": "Japanese 五十音",
  "description": "The 50-sound table as keys, read right to left (あ か さ … わ), as Gboard's 五十音 layout: tap a kana, ゛゜小 changes the one before. あa switches to letters, ?123 to the symbols pages.",
  "large": true,
